dgiot_modbus:env_check:apps/dgiot_modbus/test/tools/integration/test_runners/test_modbus_env_check.sh:环境检查测试
dgiot_modbus:hex_data:apps/dgiot_modbus/test/tools/integration/test_runners/test_modbus_hex_data.sh:十六进制数据测试
dgiot_modbus:database_report:apps/dgiot_modbus/test/tools/integration/test_runners/test_modbus_rtu_database_report.sh:数据库报告测试
dgiot_modbus:simulator_python:apps/dgiot_modbus/test/tools/integration/simulators/test_modbus_python.py:Python模拟器测试
dgiot_modbus:simulator_complete:apps/dgiot_modbus/test/tools/integration/simulators/simulate_rtu_device_complete.py:完整模拟器测试
dgiot_modbus:api_auth:apps/dgiot_modbus/test/tools/test_modbus_api_with_auth.sh:API认证测试
dgiot_modbus:integration:apps/dgiot_modbus/test/integration/run_integration_test.sh:集成测试
dgiot_modbus:all:apps/dgiot_modbus/test/integration/run_all_test_cases.sh:所有测试用例

